====================================================================================================
D. PROVENANCE — can a committed report be traced to its runs?
====================================================================================================
   committed reports          : 21
   with NO run/commit provenance: 21
   -> 94f9d214-nor-halves, 94f9d214-nor-merged, 94f9d214-nor-recolor, al1-mirror, al15-shift-frame, al16-layout-nest ...

   Consequence: a committed number cannot be re-checked against the run that
   produced it, and staleness cannot be detected mechanically (the run_ids are
   content-hashed, but the artifact never records which ones it used).
